{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMi9KaGFuc2ktJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjItJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Jhansi","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/o03Hz79hxt0Agf99jKucaBLKuDj.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6RS71SxRJKsuHQXeFMxAdh83YLs.jpg","description":"Jhansi, a boutique owner, is an independent woman staying with her partner and his daughter, but an amnesiac. When she saves a girl from a molester at a wedding, Jhansi’s past catches up with her and rekindles several bitter memories from her childhood and the violence follows.\n\nRated TV-MA · Returning Series · First aired 27 Oct 2022 · India · Language: Telugu · 35 min\nStudio: Tribal Horse Entertainment · Network: Disney+ Hotstar\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 6/6 | S2 4/4\n\nOn your server — Audio: Telugu","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Action & Adventure","Hindi"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMi9KaGFuc2ktJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjItJTI5Lw.1.1","title":"Glitches","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2022-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Memories of a horrid past haunt Jhansi and endanger the happy world she has made for herself. On top of that, an unexpected event forces her to face her other life.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6zbn1NPatmdaaLyI1RKBDtizkCC.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMi9KaGFuc2ktJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjItJTI5Lw.1.2","title":"Man from the Past","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2022-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Worried about what she has done, Jhansi meets a man from her past. International don John Caleb rules his cartel with a ruthless hand. Meanwhile, Dhruva fights for his love, Kriti.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zxMosxA0tJTHKIfCoIsnHWGvHpP.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMi9KaGFuc2ktJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjItJTI5Lw.1.3","title":"The Dark Box","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2022-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A flash of her past puts Jhansi on the trail of Ripukumar, a notorious child trafficker. Back home, a little girl goes missing in Jhansi's colony.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zooxiOsCNFbW7U83eSrcm5eaDcG.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMi9KaGFuc2ktJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjItJTI5Lw.1.4","title":"Another Murder","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2022-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"At Ripukumar's house, Jhansi meets Savithri, who gives her answers and tells her about her best pal, Barbie. Back home, a tragedy strikes Jhansi's colony.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4SL07sBw0ZNrWpjnCsQ0cXqFycd.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMi9KaGFuc2ktJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjItJTI5Lw.1.5","title":"The Vigilante","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2022-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Sakshi probes Satya's murder. Amsa Begum reunites with her son, Thayib, who has an agenda. When Sankeeth worries about Jhansi, with Dhruva's help, she strikes again.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wa77gY9VT9sn7nESy4LlQwMvBav.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMi9KaGFuc2ktJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjItJTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Billu's Club","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2022-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Sankeeth accuses Jhansi of neglecting the family. Sakshi begins suspecting Dhruva of the murders. Meanwhile, the breadcrumbs lead Jhansi and Dhruva to Goa.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uUCoPt15E52cKHFrqLKJlBmsGNx.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMi9KaGFuc2ktJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjItJTI5Lw.2.1","title":"Love and Betrayal","season":2,"episode":1,"released":"2023-01-19T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Ameesha tells Jhansi about Billu and her past life at his club. With Barbie's whereabouts